stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Scaffolded: scaffold session (spec, gates, state dirs)

    Scaffolded --> CompliancePassed: program rules read, scope confirmed
    CompliancePassed --> ReconComplete: assets enumerated, tech fingerprinted
    ReconComplete --> Authenticated: session or token obtained (or waived)
    Authenticated --> Testing: decision-tree driven class sweep
    Testing --> Validated: findings reproduced with evidence
    Validated --> CoverageComplete: every element in ledger dispositioned
    CoverageComplete --> CreativePassDone: 3+ adversarial vectors probed
    CreativePassDone --> PriorArtChecked: hacktivity search run, verdict recorded

    PriorArtChecked --> ReportReady: confirmed, provable vulnerability
    PriorArtChecked --> CleanKill: no exploitable issue found

    ReportReady --> [*]: submitted to program
    CleanKill --> [*]: outcome logged, session archived

    note right of Testing
        Includes decision-tree,
        think-like-dev devil's
        advocate pass
    end note

    note right of CreativePassDone
        Each vector probe-result:
        tested, attempted-blocked,
        or infeasible
    end note
